  "description": "Nord Drum 2 drum synthesizer: every control of its manual's MIDI CC list.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "type": "manual",
      "title": "Nord Drum 2 User Manual, OS v3.0x, Edition F",
      "notes": "MIDI controller list (page 32 of the PDF) read by tools/profiles/nord/read-nord-cc.mjs from Nord Drum 2 English User Manual v3.0x Edition F.pdf (sha256 1e3f2703f536a4f1c722ef69362ef32a9ad00108992b405c8e989139111feb5a), https://www.nordkeyboards.com/wt/documents/145/Nord%20Drum%202%20English%20User%20Manual%20v3.0x%20Edition%20F.pdf. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/nord/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/nord/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a row of the manual's MIDI controller list, with its printed name, sent as the control change it prints on the channel variable. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "The list prints controller numbers only: every value is 0 - 127, and a setting chosen from a list (a model, a waveform, an effect type) is a number here, not a choice.",
    "The manual: Tone Pitch and Echo BPM are two controllers each, MSB and LSB, the LSB to be sent first; they are laid out as printed, one parameter each.",
    "Left out, the pedals, the wheel and bank select: 0 Bank Select MSB, 32 Bank Select LSB."
  ],
